e connects to `/api/stream` for real-time updates\n- **Add Card Form**: Text input + button in each column to create new cards\n- **Collision Handling**: Server authoritative state overrides client optimistic state\n\n### Running the Application\n```bash\nnpm run dev\n```\nThis starts both servers:\n- **Frontend**: http://localhost:3000 (Vite dev server with API proxy)\n- **Backend**: http://localhost:3001 (Express + PGLite)\n\n### Acceptance Criteria Verified\n- \u2705 New cards appear on all connected clients via SSE\n- \u2705 Moving cards across columns updates all clients; card exists in exactly one column\n- \u2705 Concurrent reordering converges to identical order (server-authoritative)\n- \u2705 Concurrent moves of the same card leave it in exactly one place (no duplication/loss)\n- \u2705 Reloading any client reproduces the server's exact board state\n- \u2705 Card ordering is total and stable (fractional positions prevent collisions)"})
